    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, given that The client has allocated a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, our can assume an average annual revenue of 750,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our pricing model and target gross margin percentage, if our were to achieve the target gross margin percentage, our projected cost would be approximately 540,000 euros per year (750,000 * (1 - 0.28))." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This would result in a gross margin of 210,000 euros per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding cost-optimisation strategies, our company context suggests that our have some flexibility in managing costs through rate renegotiation with subcontractors if needed, as indicated by the budget reduction impact analysis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, absorbing a 10 percent budget reduction via rate renegotiation with subcontractors could be explored." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed information on the project specific requirements and how the project's specific requirements align with our pricing model and cost structure, it's challenging to propose precise cost-optimisation strategies beyond what is mentioned in our company context. our standard daily rates for various roles and infrastructure margin percentages provide a foundation for calculating costs, but the exact allocation of Our standard daily rates for various roles and infrastructure margin percentages to the project would significantly influence the feasibility of achieving the target gross margin percentage and identifying areas for cost optimization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an artificial intelligence solution capable of facilitating access to information, improving quality of answers, reducing times of processing, and providing a high level of relevance of the answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the AI components and innovation strategy for this tender response to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client expectations, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can leverage our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., expertise in AI research and development, particularly in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities.  our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., propose designing an AI solution centered around our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable, aligning with The client potential need for data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This model can be fine-tuned using our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., established methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tuning on a domain-specific corpus to improve a domain-specific corpus accuracy in providing relevant answers within the context of administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to information and improve the quality of answers, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., will implement a RAG system. implement involves integrating a robust retrieval strategy, such as dense vector (semantic) search or BM25 sparse search, with This model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The RAG approach allows for more accurate and context-specific responses by retrieving relevant information from internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and other documents before generating an answer. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., innovation strategy will focus on continuous improvement through quarterly fine-tuning of This model on anonymized data, ensuring compliance with GDPR regulations. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., will also prioritize explicability and transparency in our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., solution, incorporating methods like source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME to provide clear explanations for the recommendations or proposals made by the AI system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce processing times while maintaining a high level of relevance, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can utilize quantization methods such as INT8 or GPTQ to optimize This model performance without significantly compromising This model accuracy. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., goal is to achieve response times compatible with daily use by agents, aiming for a time of response under 2 seconds for current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of integration, our solution will be designed to work seamlessly with existing practices and systems, including business software, civil status, town planning, electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., recognize the importance of sovereignty and data protection, ensuring that all data is hosted within the European Union and protected appropriately through encryption and anonymization if necessary. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., approach will also include a progressive deployment strategy, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope before generalizing to all services. generalizing will be accompanied by comprehensive training for agents to ensure a smooth transition and optimal use of our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., strengths in AI research and development, particularly in LLMs and RAG capabilities, along with a focus on innovation, explicability, and compliance with regulatory requirements, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., believe our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can deliver an artificial intelligence solution that meets the client's expectations for improving access to information, answer quality, processing times, and relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

